<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Drop dead code surfaced by Periphery; tighten .periphery.yml for SwiftPM</li>
    <li>Add GitHub Actions CI for build + test, and a Periphery config scaffold</li>
    <li>Introduce os.Logger categories under the app's bundle subsystem</li>
    <li>Cap the YouTube cache at 2 GiB via CacheJanitor on launch</li>
    <li>Pin yt-dlp to a verified release and refuse mismatched binaries</li>
    <li>Add schema version to WallpaperPersistenceStore for forward-compat migrations</li></ul>
<p class="footer">MovingPaper 0.034 -- your desktop, alive.</p>
